	(text "Note for C11 (1uF Trim/NR):\n- For Breadboard/THT prototyping: Use only low-leakage,high-grade ceramic (e.g., C0G/X7R with >100MΩ IR).\n  If not available, LEAVE DNP (Do Not Populate).\n- If Vref output fluctuates or shows excessive settling/startup issues on PCB: Remove C11 first."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
