	(text "CRITICAL Note for C10 (10uF Vout Capacitor):\n- MANDATORY COMPONENT: Required for internal loop stability. DO NOT OMIT.\n- If Vref drops significantly under load or ADC readings degrade as current increases, \n  verify that C10 is properly soldered and connected.\n- Use low-ESR ceramic capacitor (1uF to 50uF, ESR <= 1.5Ω) placed close to Pin 6 and GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.764 126.238 0)
		(effects
